         route-ride tokens (apps/web/src/style.css). A walking leg is solid in the walk tone; a ride wears its own
         agency's layer tone (lyr_bus, lyr_smart, lyr_rail) and a dash, and falls back to the ride tone when the
         agency is one we have no layer for. Colour never carries the meaning: every leg is also a numbered
         sentence in the step list below the map. -->
